	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Youdao Translate Alfred Workflow

Use keyword `yd` followed by text to translate.

### Features
- Multiple translation results
- Word etymology (词源记忆)
- Word discrimination (词义辨析)
- Common collocations (常用搭配)
- Synonyms and related words

### Examples
- `yd happy` - Translate and show memory aids
- `yd 你好` - Chinese to English

Press Enter to copy the selected result.</string>
